                                                "sense_id": "627802a6-6985-398a-846b-742299c48ac3",
                                                "text": "In this, his forte, he has been less put forward than could have been desired; but when he did appear, his comicalities were infinite, and never failed to convulse the audience with laughter."
                                            }
